      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lena%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was originally shaped as a parallelogram covering twenty-six blocks for a total of 304 housing lots.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
