      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lena%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A railroad survey by Benjamin Dornblazer in 1853 charted a route that would become Lena's main artery.",
