      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lena%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Lena's 1879 opera house, later featured on American Pickers, still stands as a reminder of 19th‑century cultural ambition.",
